{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003388","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003388"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003388","label":"彭越（留侯世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"彭越","mention_ids":["c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0115","c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0184"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0115","chapter_id":"c-shiji-055-liu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-055-liu:p012","quote":"彭越"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0184","chapter_id":"c-shiji-055-liu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-055-liu:p012","quote":"彭越"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"彭越","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003388","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-055-liu:p012","chapter_id":"c-shiji-055-liu"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0184","start":184,"end":186,"surface":"彭越","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003388","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-055-liu:p012","chapter_id":"c-shiji-055-liu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji055-030","person_id":"cbr-p003388","surfaces":["彭越"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-055-liu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-055-liu:p012","quote":"項王竟不肯遣韓王，乃以為侯，又殺之彭城。良亡，間行歸漢王，漢王亦已還定三秦矣。復以良為成信侯，從東擊楚。至彭城，漢敗而還。至下邑，漢王下馬踞鞍而問曰：「吾欲捐關以東等棄之，誰可與共功者？」良進曰：「九江王黥布，楚梟將，與項王有郄；彭越與齊王田榮反梁地：此兩人可急使。而漢王之將獨韓信可屬大事，當一面。即欲捐之，捐之此三人，則楚可破也。」漢王乃遣隨何說九江王布，而使人連彭越。及魏王豹反，使韓信將兵擊之，因舉燕、代、齊、趙。然卒破楚者，此三人力也。"}],"rationale":"依明示名字、局部任事、授封及引語暫接；良久、每上冢與愛子之上排除人物短稱。老父場景的父不接張良父平；韓悼惠王不接齊王，秦王子嬰不接博浪沙秦皇帝，未名者不補姓名。神異與古代比擬不表示人物當時在場或神蹟已證。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:p012","text":"項王竟不肯遣韓王，乃以為侯，又殺之彭城。良亡，間行歸漢王，漢王亦已還定三秦矣。復以良為成信侯，從東擊楚。至彭城，漢敗而還。至下邑，漢王下馬踞鞍而問曰：「吾欲捐關以東等棄之，誰可與共功者？」良進曰：「九江王黥布，楚梟將，與項王有郄；彭越與齊王田榮反梁地：此兩人可急使。而漢王之將獨韓信可屬大事，當一面。即欲捐之，捐之此三人，則楚可破也。」漢王乃遣隨何說九江王布，而使人連彭越。及魏王豹反，使韓信將兵擊之，因舉燕、代、齊、趙。然卒破楚者，此三人力也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003384","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"韓王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003376","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"良","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003359","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003373","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003373","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"良","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003359","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003373","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0094","start":94,"end":95,"surface":"良","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003359","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0099","start":99,"end":104,"surface":"九江王黥布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003387","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003384","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"彭越","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003388","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m012-0134","start":134,"end":136,"surfac